Well, I savescum every OTHER game I play, but not nethack.

Why? Because the challenge of a straight-up ascension is what keeps
nethack fresh. Before I posted YAFAP in 2004 I had ascended a couple
of savescummed characters in 2003.

I quickly got bored and stopped playing.  Why?  Because savescumming
makes the game too easy. There's no real incentive to learn to be a
better player.  If you screw up, you just fall back to the last save
point and start over.

Since then, I've ascended 11 out of 13 classes, all three alignments,
and all four races, all without savescumming. I must say it gives me a
great feeling of accomplishment to win under the new conditions.  But
with savescumming, NH becomes just another maze game, and boredom sets
in quickly.

